        <mxCell id="note" value="Color baseline: the earlier human ER redesign, not the deployed database. Human baseline: reuse existing TICKET_ASSIGNMENT; assignee_id gains a proposed local CS_STAFF relationship. CS_RANK_CHANGE.from_rank_id and to_rank_id are distinct FKs to CS_RANK; those two lines are omitted in this focused excerpt. CS rank is internal; Auth Service still owns login roles. Proposed rule: no self-promotion; a supervisor may change lower ranks, while Admin grants SUPERVISOR." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#777777;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#222222;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="2770" width="4200" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
